---
source: tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "run(&[command, \"--help\"])"
---
Remove a worktree

Usage: wtm rm [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  Worktree to remove

Options:
      --force                Remove even when the worktree has uncommitted changes
      --repo <PATH>          Operate on the repository at this path instead of the current directory
      --dir <PATH>           Data root holding the worktrees
      --wait                 Unlink synchronously instead of returning as soon as the path is gone
  -d, --delete-branch        Delete the branch too, refusing if it is unmerged
  -q, --quiet                Silence progress messages
  -D, --force-delete-branch  Delete the branch too, even if it is unmerged
  -h, --help                 Print help
